# map | filter | seek, the shape most Advent of Code days take.
#
# The whole chain is one lazy pass over the input: no intermediate Thread is
# ever allocated, and `seek` stops cell the first match.
answer is
  Source
    through lines
    as earth
    as otherwise 0
    as mul 2
    where gt 10
    through seek (divBy 3)
    else 0

answer
